<template><div><section><h2 id="details-setup">Key Features: power and D.I.E.</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-setup-1" data-guide-step>Reach the Particle Accelerator, switch on power and activate both terminals. Enter the anomaly, retrieve the machine part through the Dark Aether tunnel and assemble Pack-a-Punch.</li>
<li id="guide-step-setup-2" data-guide-step>Kill a Megaton and its split forms to obtain the keycard. Use it at Weapons Lab to acquire the D.I.E. remote, then activate the device in Nacht’s living room.</li>
<li id="guide-step-setup-3" data-guide-step>Feed zombies into the suction trap, discharge it when full and collect the D.I.E. Shockwave.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-scope">Aetherscope and diary</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-scope-1" data-guide-step>Collect the Aetherscope components from the Dark Aether spawn locations at Yard, Crash Site and Particle Accelerator. They appear in a sequence, so revisit locations if the next part is absent.</li>
<li id="guide-step-scope-2" data-guide-step>Build the Aetherscope and use the correct anomaly to enter the Medical Bay diary sequence. Collect the diary and give it to the three spectral anomalies.</li>
<li id="guide-step-scope-3" data-guide-step>Return and enter the password at the Medical Bay computer.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-variants">Four D.I.E. variants</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-variants-1" data-guide-step>Cryo-Emitter: collect the flask and fill it using the tree’s fungus after a Megaton attack, then use it on the frozen weapon crate.</li>
<li id="guide-step-variants-2" data-guide-step>Nova-5: suck up the canister, place it at the gas station in Weapons Lab and kill a Plaguehound nearby. Take the filled canister to the weapon crate and release the gas.</li>
<li id="guide-step-variants-3" data-guide-step>Thermophasic: use the appropriate Dark Aether route to obtain the fuse and activate the cutting station, then collect the weapon upgrade.</li>
<li id="guide-step-variants-4" data-guide-step>Electrobolt: draw energy from each of the three Dark Aether crystals and discharge it into the weapon crate. Track all variants before the chamber step.</li></ol><InlineTool tool="cw-die-variants" /></section>
<section><h2 id="details-chamber">Containment chamber and wrench</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-chamber-1" data-guide-step>Shoot each chamber arm with its matching D.I.E. variant. Complete the next spectral interaction and collect the Dark Aether wrench.</li>
<li id="guide-step-chamber-2" data-guide-step>Use the wrench on the tank in Yard, clear its occupant and use an explosive on the hatch to fire the tank. Retrieve the decontamination agent and install it at Medical Bay.</li>
<li id="guide-step-chamber-3" data-guide-step>Lure both halves of a split Megaton beneath the chamber, then activate the computer to complete containment.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-finale">Orlov defense and escape</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-finale-1" data-guide-step>Finish the final Dark Aether interaction and collect the photograph only after the team is ready for the final encounter.</li>
<li id="guide-step-finale-2" data-guide-step>Protect Orlov while he works on the accelerator. Keep the paths clear and maintain armor/ammunition during each defense stage.</li>
<li id="guide-step-finale-3" data-guide-step>After power is shut down, follow the escape route while avoiding the lethal energy barriers and reach the extraction helicopter.</li></ol></section><section><h2 id="guide-sources">Sources and review</h2><p>Original concise walkthrough adapted from the sources below. Research reviewed 2026-09-30. Use their illustrated references for exact object sightlines. Gameplay verification is ongoing.</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.codzombiesguides.com/main-quests/black-ops-cold-war/die-maschine/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Supplementary walkthrough ↗</a></li></ul></section></div></template>
